,"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2315,"row":{"en":"Applicant: I've always found math to be easy. I enjoy the logical thinking and problem-solving involved. In my previous job, I was responsible for developing mathematical models to analyze data and make predictions. I also taught math courses at the local community college.","wo":"Wutkatu liggéey bi: Math dafa yàgg a yomb ci man. Lima neex ci math mooy xalaat bu logic bi ci nekk ak saafara ay jafe-jafe. Ci liggéey bima nekkoon, maa doon defar ay modeli math ngir jàngat ay done, xam fuñu jëm. Jàngale naa mat itam ci benn college sunu dëkk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWoutkatou liguey bi: Math dafa yagg a yomb thi mane. Lima nekh thi math moy khalaat bou logic bi thi nekk ak safara ay diafé-diafé. Thi liguey bima nekone, ma done defar ay model yi math nguir diangat ay données, kham fougnou dieum. Diangalé naa math itame thi bene college sounou deuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2316,"row":{"en":"Kush was a powerful kingdom that controlled much of the Nile River valley.","wo":"Kush royaume bu am doole la woon yu yoroon li gëna am solo ci valé Dexu Nile.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKoush royaume bou am dolé la wone you yorone li geuna am solo si valé Dexou Nile.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2317,"row":{"en":"I'm here to make you laugh, she said. Laughter is the best medicine, you know.","wo":"Mu tontu ko ni, Dama ñëw ngir fexe numa lay reetaan loo, ndax ree mooy garab gi dàqa faj.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou tontou ko ni, dama nieuw nguir fexe nouma lay reetaan lo, ndakh reuy moy garab gui daqa fadj.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2318,"row":{"en":"Lily knew that she had to stop them, so she ran up to the boys and told them that what they were doing was wrong.","wo":"Lily xamni def leen ko wara tere, mu daw dem ci xale yu góor ni leen li ñuy def baaxul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLily khamni def len ko wara téré,