","wo":"Soldaar ba woon daal di ree ba noppi niko, Yaakaaru ma ni mën naa ree.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSoldat ba wone daldi ré ba nopi niko yakarouma ni meun na ré.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2336,"row":{"en":"The evidence was spread all over the floor near the bread shelves.","wo":"Firnde gi mungi tasaaroowon fepp ci suuf ci wetu tegukaayu mburu yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFirndé gui moungui tassaro fépp thi souf thi wétou teuguekayou mbeureu yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2337,"row":{"en":"It is a skill thousands of years of evolution in the making, and we shouldn’t simply dismiss it in favor of technology.","wo":"Ab mën mën bu ay teemeri attu jëm kanam ci defar te warñuko rekk daadi beddi ngir xarala yu bees yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAb meun meun bou ay temerri att dieum kanam thi defar té warniouko rek dadi bedi nguir kharala you bess yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2338,"row":{"en":"In this regard, you need not worry about the facilities being available for cooking at the venue.","wo":"Suko defee jarul ngeen di jaaxle ciy jumtukaay yu ngeen di mëna toggee ca barab ba.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSouko défé diaroul ngéne di diakhle si jumtoukay you ngéne di meuna togué thia barab ba.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2339,"row":{"en":"Eyes are complex organs that allow us to see.","wo":"Bët cër la bu jafee xam bu ñuy may ñu gis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeut thieur la bou diafé kham bou gnuy may gnou guiss.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2340,"row":{"en":"least","wo":"bi gën a tuuti","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nbi gueun a touti\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2341,"row":{"en":"She is left to raise her two young children on her own, and she is struggling to find a way to handle her grief.","wo":"Ñu bàyyee ko ak ñaari doomam yu mu waral dundal boole naqar wi muy du